# trigger and 2 to combat damage, and Bot1 gains 1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Postmortem Professor
Swamp x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
